09:10.952Z","board":"written board: \"6\" \"9\""},{"seq":8,"intentId":"cd14d5c6-8cb9-4700-b208-8055874df45c:tool:19:67586","beat":"explain","skillId":"c1-maths-ch03-t02-s4","at":"2026-10-15T05:09:28.161Z","board":"written board: \"2 rotiyaan\" \"2 kha li\""}],"lane2":{"teacher":"agent","agent":{"plan":"Taaliyon se ginti; naam aur numeral; ulte numerals; mila-jula check","notes":[],"posed":["c1-maths-ch03-t02-i01","c1-maths-ch03-t02-i08","c1-maths-ch03-t02-i09","c1-maths-ch03-t02-i10","c1-maths-ch03-t02-i13","c1-maths-ch03-t02-i07","c1-maths-ch03-t02-i04","c1-maths-ch03-t02-i02","c1-maths-ch03-t02-i06","c1-maths-ch03-t02-i05","c1-maths-ch03-t02-i11","c1-maths-ch03-t02-i03"],"skill":"c1-maths-ch03-t02-s4","turns":[{"who":"child","text":"saat"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, saat taaliyaan. Saat aur 7 ek hi ginti hain. Ab cricket mein batsman bina run banaye out hua. Uska score kya hai?"},{"who":"child","text":"zero?"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, zero run! Score mein 0 likhte hain. Ab 3, 2, 1 se ulta gino. Aage kya aayega?"},{"who":"child","text":"zero"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, 1 ke baad ulta ginte hue zero aata hai. Ab cricket mein teen run bane, phir teenon hata diye. Score par kaunsa number likhenge?"},{"who":"child","text":"zero"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, zero chidiya bachi. Jab ek bhi nahi bachi, hum 0 likhte hain. Taar par chidiya nahi hain, phir bhi zero ko number kyun bolte hain?"},{"who":"child","text":"umm... kyunki... zero bhi toh ek number hai na?"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, zero ek number hai. Socho cricket mein koi run nahi bana, toh score batane ke liye kya likhenge?"},{"who":"child","text":"zero likhenge... kyunki kuch nahi bana toh bhi batana padta hai na... jaise kuch nahi hai toh zero bataata hai"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, bilkul. Zero batata hai ki ek bhi run nahi bana. Ab seven ka numeral kya hai, aur Hindi mein kya bolte hain?"},{"who":"child","text":"seven matlab 7... aur Hindi mein saat bolte hain"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, seven ka numeral 7 hai, aur Hindi mein saat. Ab Bholu ne ghar ka number 6 ulta likha. Kya woh ab bhi chhah hai?"},{"who":"child","text":"nahi... 6 ulta likha toh woh 9 ban jaata hai... woh chhah nahi hai"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, bilkul. 6 ulta karne par 9 banta hai, chhah nahi rehta. Dono mein fark kaise pehchaanoge?"},{"who":"child","text":"umm... 6 ka gol neeche hota hai aur 9 ka upar... jaise 9 ka bada gol upar."},{"who":"teacher","text":"Bilkul, 6 ka gol neeche aur 9 ka gol upar hota hai. Ab naam wala ek sawaal: nau ka numeral kya hai?"},{"who":"child","text":"9... nau matlab 9"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, nau ka numeral 9 hai. Ab cricket mein do run bane, phir do aur bane. Total kitne run hue?"},{"who":"child","text":"umm... do aur do... char run hue?"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, do aur do milkar chaar run hue. Ab do rotiyaan thi, aur tumne dono kha li. Kitni bachi?"},{"who":"child","text":"zero"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, zero rotiyaan bachi, kyunki dono kha li. Aaj tumne ginti, number ke naam, 6 aur 9 ka fark, aur zero par baat ki. Kya aaj ke liye yahin rukna hai?"}],"usage":{"usd":0.06512,"tokens":50871},"boards":8,"lastMs":2206,"screen":{"on":"board","texts":["2 rotiyaan","2 kha li"],"words":"the board shows writing; written on it: 2 rotiyaan; 2 kha li"},"learner":{"c1-maths-ch03-t02-s1":{"read":"understood","graded":[{"g":"correct","item":"c1-maths-ch03-t02-i01","kind":"practice"},{"g":"correct","item":"c1-maths-ch03-t02-i09","kind":"near_transfer"}],"grades":["correct","correct"],"evidence":"Do aur do, phir zero transfer sahi"},"c1-maths-ch03-t02-s2":{"read":"partly","depth":"untested","graded":[{"g":"correct","item":"c1-maths-ch03-t02-i02","kind":"practice"},{"g":"correct","item":"c1-maths-ch03-t02-i11","kind":"retrieval"}],"grades":["correct","correct"],"evidence":"Nau aur 9 sahi; transfer abhi baaki"},"c1-maths-ch03-t02-s3":{"read":"understood","graded":[{"g":"correct","item":"c1-maths-ch03-t02-i06","kind":"error_spot"}